```Title: Domain Group Membership Discovery (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1069.002 | Severity: low | Sigma id: d85ecf95-9135-4091-b756-b9f25739e1be```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators and identity management scripts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity low.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
((Image IN ("*\\net.exe", "*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="*group*" CommandLine="*/domain*" NOT (CommandLine IN ("*/add*", "*/delete*"))) OR CommandLine IN ("*Get-ADGroupMember*", "*Get-DomainGroupMember*", "*Get-NetGroupMember*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
